     A                                  1  2'Help - Notepad'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Your own notes, oldest first, on a-
     A                                       yellow pad.  Nobody else can see t-
     A                                      hem.'
     A                                  5  3'Type a word in Find and press Ente-
     A                                      r to show only the notes that conta-
     A                                      in it.'
     A                                  6  3'Options: 2 changes a note, 4 delet-
     A                                      es it.'
     A                                  7  3'You can also put the cursor on a l-
     A                                      ine and press Enter to pick it.'
     A                                  9  3'F6 writes a new note.  F9 prints a-
     A                                      ll of your notes.'
     A                                 10  3'F7 and F8 page backward and forwar-
     A                                      d through a long list.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
